<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Naomi Talish said in a research note that she initiated coverage of MGM Grand Inc with intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Talish also set a $41 per share 12-month price objective.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 1/2 to 36-3/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
